'' RUN: what a byref result binds by 'return' -- a static, a shared, a byref parameter, a
'' dereference, a byref call of the same type, a derived object, a const result -- still
'' builds and binds. Expected output is fbc-modern 1.20's, byte for byte.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/diagnostics/src/byref-result-return-ok.tiko -o tests/codegen/byrefretok.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/byrefretok.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/byrefretok.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  9 8 7 0 7
